<Style id="g10opt"><LineStyle><color>992d52a0</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Style id="g10con"><LineStyle><color>ff8a8a8a</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Folder><name>Group 10</name>
<Placemark><name>G10 START</name><description>Junction of Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร) &amp; Lane around the south &amp; east side of the sports ground (ซอยรอบสนามกีฬา (ด้านใต้/ตะวันออก))</description><Point><coordinates>99.1893,10.49903,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G10 step 1: Lane around the south &amp; east side of the sports ground</name><description>Start here. Head east along Lane around the south &amp; east side of the sports ground (ซอยรอบสนามกีฬา (ด้านใต้/ตะวันออก)) for about 940 m to the junction with Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6. [Partly missing from Google Maps: the south and east sides of this lane (~570 m) are not routable in Google, so follow the line on the map; the last ~370 m is in Google]</description><styleUrl>#g10film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.1893,10.49903,0 99.18989,10.499,0 99.19041,10.49873,0 99.19049,10.49857,0 99.19036,10.4981,0 99.19008,10.49661,0 99.18972,10.49529,0 99.18946,10.49473,0 99.18943,10.49441,0 99.18936,10.49436,0 99.18926,10.49436,0 99.18873,10.49454,0 99.18825,10.49462,0 99.1878,10.49462,0 99.18748,10.49468,0 99.1874,10.49476,0 99.18736,10.49492,0 99.18744,10.49551,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G10 step 2: Lane inside the sports ground</name><description>Turn right onto Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading east for about 30 m to where it meets Road inside the sports ground (south loop) (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา).</description><styleUrl>#g10film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18744,10.49551,0 99.1876,10.49547,0 99.18774,10.49544,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G10 step 3: Road inside the sports ground (south loop)</name><description>Bear right onto Road inside the sports ground (south loop) (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading south-east for about 170 m to the next junction.</description><styleUrl>#g10film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18774,10.49544,0 99.18787,10.49539,0 99.18803,10.49519,0 99.1882,10.49504,0 99.18847,10.49494,0 99.18874,10.49496,0 99.18896,10.49504,0 99.18908,10.49512,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G10 step 4: Road inside the sports ground (south loop)</name><description>Bear left to stay on Road inside the sports ground (south loop) (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading north for about 170 m to the finish point.</description><styleUrl>#g10film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18908,10.49512,0 99.18918,10.4953,0 99.1894,10.4962,0 99.18938,10.49636,0 99.18925,10.49655,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G10 FINISH</name><description>Inside the sports ground, next to the municipal tennis courts (สนามเทนนิสเทศบาลเมืองชุมพร)</description><Point><coordinates>99.18925,10.49655,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
</Document></kml>